{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>For in the shadow.</b> Then the wise man will find shelter in the shadow of wisdom and in the shadow of silver, but there is a difference between the shadow of wisdom and the shadow of silver, for wisdom gives life to its possessor, for wisdom is the form of the supernal soul that does not die at the death of the body:"], :book :ecclesiastes, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%A7%D7%94%D7%9C%D7%AA"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:28:04.786365519Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}